{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  GS PRODUCT COLORS OPTION (colorway swatches)
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 snippets/product-colors-option.liquid
  ==================================================================
  USAGE:
    render 'gs-product-colors-option', cardProduct: product

  DATA MODEL (unchanged from v3):
  Grunt Style models colorways as SEPARATE products linked by a product
  list metafield. This snippet reads:
    cardProduct.metafields.custom.product_swatches            (product list)
    <product>.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_image
    <product>.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_hex_code
  The card's own swatch renders first, then each linked sibling.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  CRITICAL FIX: 28 MUTATION OBSERVERS PER PAGE
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 emitted its script block OUTSIDE the if-guard, so it rendered on
  every call whether the product had swatches or not. Each copy ran
  obs.observe(document.body, { childList: true, subtree: true }).

  A 28-product collection page therefore attached TWENTY-EIGHT
  MutationObservers to document.body, each watching the entire subtree.
  Every DOM mutation anywhere fired all 28 callbacks, each iterating the
  mutation list and running querySelector. With infinite scroll adding
  cards, the observer count kept climbing for the life of the session.

  This snippet now emits MARKUP ONLY. No script, no observer.
  Behaviour lives in assets/gs-swatch-scroller.js, loaded ONCE per page.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  SWIPER DEPENDENCY REMOVED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 instantiated a Swiper per swatch row. Swiper is 154 KB and slated
  for removal (audit ref GS-007). The row is now a native overflow
  scroller with CSS scroll-snap: touch, trackpad, and keyboard all work
  with no library. Arrow buttons are progressive enhancement.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. ~120 LINES OF DEAD CODE. Roughly 7 KB of this 11 KB file was an
     options_with_values implementation wrapped in a Liquid comment.
     Liquid still tokenizes commented blocks, so it cost parse time on
     every card render. Deleted; it remains in v3 if ever needed.

  2. WRONG AVAILABILITY. Inside the loop over sibling products, v3 read
     cardProduct.available rather than the sibling being rendered, so
     every colorway reported the PARENT product's stock status. Fixed.

  3. UNQUOTED ATTRIBUTE VALUE on data-quick-view-availability. Quoted.

  4. TRIPLE BRACE TYPO in a product.url reference in the dead block.
     Gone with the dead block.

  5. NO ACCESSIBLE NAME on hex-code swatches. They were empty anchors
     carrying only a background colour, so screen readers announced
     nothing. Each now carries its colorway title, and the row is a
     labelled list.

  6. Dropped the dependency on snippets/carousal-arrows.liquid, which is
     misspelled and therefore invisible to a grep for 'carousel'
     (audit ref DUP-023).
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  unless cardProduct
    break
  endunless

  assign swatches = cardProduct.metafields.custom.product_swatches.value
  assign own_image = cardProduct.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_image
  assign own_hex = cardProduct.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_hex_code
  assign has_own = false
  if own_image or own_hex
    assign has_own = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if swatches.size > 0 or has_own -%}
  {{ 'gs-product-colors-option.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

  <div class="product-selector-option select-color color-option">
    <div class="gs-swatch-scroller" data-swatch-scroller>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="gs-swatch-scroller__btn gs-swatch-scroller__btn--prev"
        data-swatch-scroll="prev"
        aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.previous_slide' | t | default: 'Previous' }}"
        hidden
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M15 4 L7 12 L15 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>

      <ul
        class="unstylish-list product-selector-option-list gs-swatch-track"
        data-swatch-colors
        data-swatch-track
        aria-label="{{ 'products.product.color_options' | t | default: 'Colour options' }}"
      >
        {%- if has_own -%}
          <li class="variant-option gs-swatch-track__item">
            <a
              href="{{ cardProduct.url }}"
              class="option{% if own_hex and own_image == blank %} option--hex{% endif %}"
              title="{{ cardProduct.title | escape }}"
              aria-label="{{ cardProduct.title | escape }}"
              aria-current="true"
              data-quick-view-availability="{{ cardProduct.available }}"
              data-quick-view
              {%- if own_image == blank and own_hex %} style="background-color: {{ own_hex }};"{% endif -%}
            >
              {%- if own_image -%}{{ own_image | metafield_tag }}{%- endif -%}
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- for swatch_product in swatches -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign sib_image = swatch_product.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_image
            assign sib_hex = swatch_product.metafields.custom.collection_color_swatch_hex_code
          -%}
          {%- if sib_image or sib_hex -%}
            <li class="variant-option gs-swatch-track__item{% unless swatch_product.available %} out-of-stock{% endunless %}">
              <a
                href="{{ swatch_product.url }}"
                class="option{% if sib_hex and sib_image == blank %} option--hex{% endif %}"
                title="{{ swatch_product.title | escape }}"
                aria-label="{{ swatch_product.title | escape }}"
                data-quick-view-availability="{{ swatch_product.available }}"
                data-quick-view
                {%- if sib_image == blank and sib_hex %} style="background-color: {{ sib_hex }};"{% endif -%}
              >
                {%- if sib_image -%}{{ sib_image | metafield_tag }}{%- endif -%}
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="gs-swatch-scroller__btn gs-swatch-scroller__btn--next"
        data-swatch-scroll="next"
        aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.next_slide' | t | default: 'Next' }}"
        hidden
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M9 4 L17 12 L9 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
